/tools/

# Audit / handoff scratch. These are session artifacts, not source: one-off
# fuzz+soak harnesses, their captured stdout, and the long-form audit write-ups
# that drove a batch of fixes. The fixes and their regression tests live in
# src/ and src/*/tests where a contributor can actually run them; keeping the
# scratch out means `git clone` gives you the codebase, not somebody's session
# log (which also carried absolute C:\Users\<name>\... paths). Archived outside
# the repo on the machines that still want them.
/CRASH_AUDIT.md
/MAKER_AUDIT.md
/audit_harness/
/verify_theme_crash.py
/*_HANDOFF.md
